## 後端開發規範（NestJS）

### 標準模組結構

```
{module}/
├── {module}.module.ts
├── controllers/{module}.controller.ts
├── services/{module}.service.ts
└── dto/{module}.dto.ts
```

### Controller 規則

```typescript
@Controller('{resource}')
@UseGuards(JwtAuthGuard, RolesGuard)
@Roles('ADMIN')
export class XxxController {
  constructor(private readonly xxx: XxxService) {}

  @Post()
  async create(@Body() body: CreateXxxBody, @Req() req: any) {
    const actorUserId = req?.user?.sub as string | undefined;
    const ipAddr = (req?.ip as string | undefined) ?? null;
    const userAgent = (req?.headers?.['user-agent'] as string | undefined) ?? null;
    return this.xxx.create(body, { actorUserId, ipAddr, userAgent });
  }
}
```

### Service 規則

- ID 由 DB DEFAULT `gen_xxx_id()` 產生，不需手動指定
- Prisma P2002 錯誤 = unique constraint → 回傳 `BadRequestException`
- AuditLog 寫入時機：CREATE / UPDATE / SET_ACTIVE
- 無 actorUserId 時不寫 AuditLog
- 系統內建資料（is_system=true）不可修改 code

### AuditLog 寫入格式

```typescript
await this.audit.write({
  actorUserId: ctx.actorUserId,
  moduleCode: 'NX01',          // 依模組填入（新代碼）
  action: 'CREATE',             // CREATE / UPDATE / SET_ACTIVE / DELETE
  entityTable: 'nx01_xxx',
  entityId: row.id,
  entityCode: row.code,
  summary: `Create xxx ${row.code}`,
  beforeData: null,
  afterData: { /* 異動後的欄位 */ },
  ipAddr: ctx.ipAddr ?? null,
  userAgent: ctx.userAgent ?? null,
});
```

